@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Terms of Service";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
            <nav aria-label="breadcrumb" class="mb-4">
                <ol class="breadcrumb">
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">Home</a></li>
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Terms of Service</li>
                </ol>
            </nav>

            <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
                    <div class="bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success p-3 rounded-circle me-3">
                        <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-text-fill fs-2"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-1">Terms of Service</h2>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Doctor Appointment System User Agreement</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <hr class="my-4 text-muted" />

                <div class="content text-secondary lh-lg">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle text-success me-2"></i>1. Acceptance of Terms</h5>
                    <p>By registering, scheduling, or managing doctor appointments through this platform, you agree to comply with and be legally bound by these terms.</p>

                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4"><i class="bi bi-calendar-check text-success me-2"></i>2. Appointment Booking & Punctuality</h5>
                    <p>Patients are expected to arrive at the hospital chamber at least 15 minutes before the scheduled time slot. In case of unexpected doctor delays due to emergency surgeries, patients will be notified promptly.</p>

                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4"><i class="bi bi-person-check text-success me-2"></i>3. Accuracy of Information</h5>
                    <p>Users must provide accurate personal, phone number, and medical details. Impersonation or fraudulent bookings may lead to permanent account suspension.</p>

                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4"><i class="bi bi-credit-card text-success me-2"></i>4. Consultation Fees</h5>
                    <p>Consultation fees are set by the respective doctors/hospitals. Payments can be completed online via bKash, Nagad, Card, or in cash at the chamber counter.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
